cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Solubility Prediction with Molecular Descriptors
message: >-
  Solubility Predictor to compare different machine learning
  models
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Alexander
    family-names: Haag
    email: alexander.haag@uni-jena.de
    affiliation: FSU Jena
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0009-8198-8877'
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/AlexanderHaag/Erweitertes-Forschungspraktikum
abstract: >-
  This project trains Random Forest, Extra Trees, and
  CatBoost regression models to predict solvent-dependent
  solubility (`logS`) from molecular and solvent descriptors
  calculated with RDKit.
license: MIT
